  "citation": "O'Brien J; Tuftedal M; Wawrzyniak E; Berkelhammer M; Grover M; Collis S; Sankaran R; Beckman P; Ferrier N; Shahkarami S; Kim Y; Park S; Dematties D; Conrad N (2024): CROCUS Air Quality Data at University of Illinois - Chicago Tower. Community Research on Climate and Urban Science Urban Integrated Field Laboratory (CROCUS UIFL). Dataset. doi:10.15485/2482533",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
